WEBVTT

01:31.232 --> 01:34.388
[Episode 20]

01:38.464 --> 01:39.480
[Longevity]

01:39.480 --> 01:41.540
Mother, be careful.

01:46.560 --> 01:49.599
Everyone, please take your seats.

01:49.599 --> 01:50.599
Take your seats.

01:50.599 --> 01:54.000
Today is my mother's eightieth birthday.

01:54.000 --> 01:55.920
Thank you all for coming.

01:55.920 --> 01:58.980
I am deeply grateful.

02:01.640 --> 02:05.280
Now, let's raise a cup together.

02:05.280 --> 02:09.039
- Sure.
- A long, healthy, and happy life

02:09.039 --> 02:11.180
to my mother.

02:12.719 --> 02:16.080
Ms. Yan, the Zhao family is truly rich.

02:16.080 --> 02:18.319
For starters,
they ordered premium bird's nest.

02:18.319 --> 02:21.060
Their deposit alone
equals our entire month's revenue.

02:22.759 --> 02:25.520
Thank you both for coming.

02:25.520 --> 02:26.879
- Congratulations.
- Today is a fine day.

02:26.879 --> 02:29.319
Cheers. A happy, long life

02:29.319 --> 02:30.759
to you.

02:30.759 --> 02:32.259
Cheers!

02:37.439 --> 02:39.080
Making money is secondary.

02:39.080 --> 02:40.879
If we pull off this birthday banquet,

02:40.879 --> 02:42.819
Bofeng House's reputation will surely soar.

02:46.159 --> 02:49.159
- Mother, it's me!
- Mother!

02:49.159 --> 02:51.159
What's going on?

02:51.159 --> 02:52.659
Go!

03:00.800 --> 03:02.539
Murder!

03:16.120 --> 03:19.539
What did you feed us, you evil woman?

03:25.280 --> 03:26.780
Ms. Yan!

03:28.479 --> 03:30.719
Zhao Cai, close the door at once!

03:30.719 --> 03:32.439
Jin Bao, go fetch a physician.

03:32.439 --> 03:35.199
Everyone else, restrain the raving diners,
but be careful not to get hurt.

03:35.199 --> 03:37.680
Yes.

03:37.680 --> 03:38.800
According to the coroner,

03:38.800 --> 03:41.319
those four had internal injuries,
and their pupils dilated.

03:41.319 --> 03:43.199
It's exactly the mental symptom
of taking the Eternity Pill.

03:43.199 --> 03:44.479
What's worse,

03:44.479 --> 03:46.159
the poison does not act suddenly.

03:46.159 --> 03:48.479
It accumulates over time,
incessantly injuring a person's mind.

03:48.479 --> 03:50.080
Ling Yun Fei is behind it.

03:50.080 --> 03:52.199
These people can move upon hearing a whistle.

03:52.199 --> 03:54.560
They're clearly trained men.

03:54.560 --> 03:57.120
So, those commoners
who vanished from the capital outskirts

03:57.120 --> 03:59.120
have all been taken by Ling Yun Fei?

03:59.120 --> 04:00.960
Your speculation is probably right.

04:00.960 --> 04:03.560
Now, finding Ling Yun Fei's poison workshop

04:03.560 --> 04:05.400
is the key to unraveling all these mysteries.

04:05.400 --> 04:06.840
Those four all died.

04:06.840 --> 04:08.360
Liu Ru Yan was also silenced.

04:08.360 --> 04:09.960
All our leads are dead.

04:09.960 --> 04:12.360
Perhaps we can start
with the ingredient of Eternity Pill.

04:12.360 --> 04:14.840
Yin Qing, what did you get?

04:14.840 --> 04:17.279
Miss, I've examined it carefully.

04:17.279 --> 04:19.879
The ingredient of Eternity Pill
is called Fuqing herb.

04:19.879 --> 04:21.680
Its petals are purple and spread open.

04:21.680 --> 04:23.959
Its stamens are pure white,
and its leaves are emerald green.

04:23.959 --> 04:25.519
It grows in staggered fashion
along the stems.

04:25.519 --> 04:27.319
But its growing environment
is particularly unique.

04:27.319 --> 04:29.379
It favors only damp, warm places.

04:30.920 --> 04:33.439
Mr. Yin, what a surprise.

04:33.439 --> 04:34.879
You know quite a lot.

04:34.879 --> 04:36.360
With so many skills,

04:36.360 --> 04:37.759
how come you were not
given important jobs before?

04:37.759 --> 04:41.000
It's not easy to meet someone
who can see my talent.

04:41.000 --> 04:45.680
So I'm thankful to Miss Meng
for recognizing my talent.

04:45.680 --> 04:47.240
Sure, you have talent.

04:47.240 --> 04:48.240
Yin Qing,

04:48.240 --> 04:50.560
if I did not know your abilities,

04:50.560 --> 04:52.000
I would really suspect

04:52.000 --> 04:55.500
that you got into the Censorate
through flattery alone.

04:57.519 --> 05:00.439
The Fuqing herb has quite a strong nature.

05:00.439 --> 05:04.839
In the short term, it causes hallucinations.
Long-term use of it leads to madness.

05:04.839 --> 05:08.240
Users will even draw a sword
at the sight of a mosquito.

05:08.240 --> 05:10.839
Then how does it differ from Wushi Powder?

05:10.839 --> 05:14.240
Its potency is a thousand times stronger
than Wushi Powder, and it's highly addictive.

05:14.240 --> 05:16.160
Apart from the mental euphoria,

05:16.160 --> 05:19.360
users' physical strength surges wildly,
leading to exhaustion and death.

05:19.360 --> 05:21.639
If this virulent poison spreads
among the common folk,

05:21.639 --> 05:23.839
it will pose a deadly threat to the people.

05:23.839 --> 05:28.360
This poison endangers the people's safety.

05:28.360 --> 05:30.319
If we allow it to circulate,

05:30.319 --> 05:32.879
the whole country will be in grave peril.

05:32.879 --> 05:36.720
Nian, do you know of any unique valley
fit for the Fuqing herb's growth?

05:36.720 --> 05:39.120
Although such a valley is rare,

05:39.120 --> 05:40.879
our country is vast with various valleys.

05:40.879 --> 05:43.879
And finding the right one is
like looking for a needle in a haystack.

05:43.879 --> 05:47.519
Since you all haven't eaten yet,
I made some pastries.

05:47.519 --> 05:51.120
You're talented, yet you rarely cook.

05:51.120 --> 05:52.120
Are these edible?

05:52.120 --> 05:53.639
You don't have to eat.

05:53.639 --> 05:55.379
- Someone will--
- I love them.

05:57.079 --> 06:00.839
Mr. Shen, usually, you sweet-talk us,

06:00.839 --> 06:04.040
but why are you so picky
with your own sister?

06:04.040 --> 06:05.800
I was wrong.

06:05.800 --> 06:09.319
How dare I say
my own sister's cooking is not good?

06:09.319 --> 06:13.100
Look, even the plating is
as beautiful as a carefully painted picture.

06:14.079 --> 06:15.579
The painting!

06:17.160 --> 06:18.879
Liu Ru Yan's painting!

06:18.879 --> 06:20.379
Yin Qing.

06:24.864 --> 06:27.160
Liu Ru Yan hid this painting
in a secret compartment,

06:27.160 --> 06:30.040
which means the place depicted is not fake.

06:30.040 --> 06:31.759
She might have actually been there.

06:31.759 --> 06:34.360
Hibiscus flowers favor warm, humid places,

06:34.360 --> 06:36.600
just like the Fuqing herb.

06:36.600 --> 06:40.920
Di Nian, take men immediately
and search the outskirts for similar areas.

06:40.920 --> 06:42.920
Miss Meng.

06:42.920 --> 06:43.920
Miss Meng.

06:43.920 --> 06:47.060
Something really bad
happened at Bofeng House!

06:51.360 --> 06:52.360
Stop!

06:52.360 --> 06:53.439
Give me back my husband!

06:53.439 --> 06:55.000
- Stop!
- What's going on?

06:55.000 --> 06:56.439
Fu Zhi!

06:56.439 --> 07:00.000
Miss Meng, you must do justice!

07:00.000 --> 07:03.959
I held the birthday banquet here
only for your sake.

07:03.959 --> 07:06.680
If anything happens to my husband,

07:06.680 --> 07:08.279
how can I possibly go on living?

07:08.279 --> 07:10.240
Even with your backing, Miss Meng,

07:10.240 --> 07:12.560
Ms. Yan must give us an explanation.

07:12.560 --> 07:15.600
Right! Without an explanation,
none of you are leaving.

07:15.600 --> 07:18.600
Nobody is leaving!

07:18.600 --> 07:20.319
What are you doing?

07:20.319 --> 07:21.819
Stop it!

07:24.279 --> 07:27.399
Those who want justice,
save the people with me.

07:27.399 --> 07:31.120
Those who want to cause trouble,
I will not let you off.

07:31.120 --> 07:33.740
Save them!

07:36.879 --> 07:38.980
My lord!

07:58.279 --> 08:00.600
Miss Meng, the liquor is poisoned.

08:00.600 --> 08:02.319
Judging from the intense medicinal property,

08:02.319 --> 08:04.160
it is very likely Eternity Pill.

08:04.160 --> 08:05.660
Huxiao Gang!

08:07.560 --> 08:09.279
They did this to get back at me.

08:09.279 --> 08:12.720
These people must be treated immediately,
or their lives are in danger.

08:12.720 --> 08:14.519
Where is Miss Yan? She was just here.

08:14.519 --> 08:16.980
- How did she disappear suddenly?
- Miss Meng.

08:23.800 --> 08:25.079
<i>Meng Ting Hui,</i>

08:25.079 --> 08:26.720
<i>you killed the one I love most.</i>

08:26.720 --> 08:29.160
<i>I will make your best friend suffer.</i>

08:29.160 --> 08:32.440
<i>If you want to save Yan Fu Zhi, come alone.</i>

08:32.440 --> 08:35.039
<i>Otherwise, you'll see her dead body.</i>

08:35.039 --> 08:36.539
Fu Zhi!

08:45.000 --> 08:47.080
If the court does not hand over Meng Ting Hui

08:47.080 --> 08:49.320
before the hour of Xu today,

08:49.320 --> 08:51.960
I'll kill everyone in the entire capital
with the Eternity Pill.

08:51.960 --> 08:53.820
By Ling Yun Fei.

08:54.679 --> 08:56.039
Shun.

08:56.039 --> 08:57.940
Run!

08:58.679 --> 09:00.379
Run!

09:12.960 --> 09:14.679
Absurd!

09:14.679 --> 09:17.480
A mere Huxiao Gang is quite brazen!

09:17.480 --> 09:19.240
Your Majesty.

09:19.240 --> 09:21.799
The Huxiao Gang must be eradicated,
and Ling Yun Fei must be captured.

09:21.799 --> 09:23.679
The people also need to be pacified.

09:23.679 --> 09:26.519
I have heard
that many were poisoned at Bofeng House,

09:26.519 --> 09:28.919
and local clinics are overwhelmed.

09:28.919 --> 09:31.519
The city is also full of threatening letters,

09:31.519 --> 09:33.279
causing widespread panic.

09:33.279 --> 09:36.480
All this stems from Meng Ting Hui.

09:36.480 --> 09:38.240
If we just hand her over,

09:38.240 --> 09:41.159
we can appease both Ling Yun Fei
and the people.

09:41.159 --> 09:42.720
That's the best way.

09:42.720 --> 09:44.519
Your Majesty, I second that.

09:44.519 --> 09:46.559
Although Meng Ting Hui punishes evildoers,

09:46.559 --> 09:48.399
she has also provoked the Huxiao Gang.

09:48.399 --> 09:51.399
Your Majesty, if you still shield her,
it may damage your image.

09:51.399 --> 09:53.879
Ling Yun Fei posted threatening letters
all over the city.

09:53.879 --> 09:55.720
Is he provoking Meng Ting Hui?

09:55.720 --> 10:00.039
He is provoking me and the national prestige!

10:00.039 --> 10:01.919
If I compromise,

10:01.919 --> 10:03.600
that will truly damage my image.

10:03.600 --> 10:07.679
Your Majesty,
all officials are now waiting outside.

10:07.679 --> 10:10.519
If Your Majesty refuses to hand her over,
they may not agree.

10:10.519 --> 10:12.080
Today, let alone Meng Ting Hui,

10:12.080 --> 10:13.960
even if it were any other official,

10:13.960 --> 10:15.639
I will never compromise.

10:15.639 --> 10:18.480
Instead of thinking
how to fight the gang together,

10:18.480 --> 10:21.120
both of you are here forcing me
to hand her over.

10:21.120 --> 10:24.000
Your Majesty, there are less than six hours
before the hour of Xu.

10:24.000 --> 10:25.240
If the search yields no results,

10:25.240 --> 10:26.799
and Huxiao Gang kills the commoners

10:26.799 --> 10:28.960
with the Eternity Pill,

10:28.960 --> 10:30.759
how will we deal with it then?

10:30.759 --> 10:32.259
Your Majesty!

10:33.840 --> 10:36.320
Your Majesty, Miss Meng has come to see you

10:36.320 --> 10:40.659
and has volunteered
to go and meet Ling Yun Fei.

10:50.039 --> 10:51.720
Seal all exits.

10:51.720 --> 10:53.220
- Search.
- Yes!

10:54.720 --> 10:58.080
Your Majesty, the situation is most urgent.

10:58.080 --> 10:59.759
Please allow me to go alone.

10:59.759 --> 11:01.120
This concerns national dignity.

11:01.120 --> 11:03.000
It is not the time for you to play the hero.

11:03.000 --> 11:04.679
I've already sent Zhi Shu,
Di Nian, and Huang Bo

11:04.679 --> 11:07.039
to search the entire city
for the Huxiao Gang and Ling Yun Fei.

11:07.039 --> 11:08.200
That's it.

11:08.200 --> 11:11.440
Ling Yun Fei is convinced
that I killed Liu Ru Yan

11:11.440 --> 11:12.799
and wants a life for a life.

11:12.799 --> 11:15.440
If my life can be exchanged
for Fu Zhi and the people of the capital--

11:15.440 --> 11:16.519
Meng Ting Hui!

11:16.519 --> 11:18.600
This involves the dark forces.

11:18.600 --> 11:20.179
Do you take this as child's play?

11:21.000 --> 11:22.799
I won't change my mind.

11:22.799 --> 11:23.960
You may leave.

11:23.960 --> 11:25.860
I won't change my mind either.

11:26.679 --> 11:30.580
Even if it means death, I must go.

11:36.360 --> 11:38.279
Miss Meng actually defied His Majesty.

11:38.279 --> 11:41.500
She is quite bold.

11:43.519 --> 11:44.919
Miss Meng.

11:44.919 --> 11:46.919
Zhi Shu has gone to search for Miss Yan.

11:46.919 --> 11:49.320
His Majesty has also sent the Divine Guards
to search the capital.

11:49.320 --> 11:51.080
They will surely find Fu Zhi.

11:51.080 --> 11:53.100
Why must you risk your own life?

11:54.600 --> 11:57.080
I am going for Fu Zhi,

11:57.080 --> 11:59.399
and also for the people of the capital.

11:59.399 --> 12:01.200
Ling Yun Fei wants me.

12:01.200 --> 12:02.960
It is time to settle things with him.

12:02.960 --> 12:04.679
Miss Meng, we knew we couldn't dissuade you.

12:04.679 --> 12:07.360
How about letting me go instead?

12:07.360 --> 12:08.960
Having worked with you for so long,

12:08.960 --> 12:11.159
I can imitate your words and actions.

12:11.159 --> 12:12.559
Ling Yun Fei won't recognize the difference.

12:12.559 --> 12:15.080
Can Ling Yun Fei not tell a man from a woman?

12:15.080 --> 12:17.879
Ling Yun Fei asked me to come alone.

12:17.879 --> 12:20.899
If he sees anyone else,
Fu Zhi's life will be in danger.

12:21.639 --> 12:24.679
This game must be played by his rules.

12:24.679 --> 12:27.240
Miss Meng, if you insist on going,
drink this soup.

12:27.240 --> 12:30.679
It's made with Qi Supplement.

12:30.679 --> 12:32.480
You may have no internal strength,

12:32.480 --> 12:35.159
but it can help you become strong and agile.

12:35.159 --> 12:37.720
You must drink it, or we cannot let you go.

12:37.720 --> 12:39.000
Exactly.

12:39.000 --> 12:42.100
At least taking this
will reassure us a little.

12:58.399 --> 12:59.899
I'm leaving.

13:14.720 --> 13:17.500
You drugged me!

13:20.519 --> 13:23.899
Forgive us, Miss Meng.
We had no better choice.

13:29.480 --> 13:32.000
She can sleep
until the hour of Chen tomorrow.

13:32.000 --> 13:33.039
When she wakes up,

13:33.039 --> 13:35.080
whether she punishes me or hates me,

13:35.080 --> 13:36.240
I will take it.

13:36.240 --> 13:38.240
I will immediately take men to find Miss Yan.

13:38.240 --> 13:41.100
I will also re-check the clues
from Wanxiang Pavilion.

13:56.840 --> 13:58.519
Search carefully, all of you!

13:58.519 --> 14:00.019
Yes.

14:16.279 --> 14:17.779
Found it.

14:19.279 --> 14:21.200
Your Majesty.

14:21.200 --> 14:23.340
This is the fluorite powder left
by Miss Meng.

14:29.200 --> 14:31.240
If you are determined to go,

14:31.240 --> 14:33.080
I will send men to protect you secretly.

14:33.080 --> 14:35.399
Ling Yun Fei wants me to go alone.

14:35.399 --> 14:37.600
If he senses anything else, Fu Zhi's life--

14:37.600 --> 14:39.820
This is my final concession.

14:45.320 --> 14:47.279
You are a subject of mine.

14:47.279 --> 14:49.960
I'll never put you in danger.

14:49.960 --> 14:51.440
Leave markings along the way.

14:51.440 --> 14:53.360
Zhi Shu and Di Nian will follow covertly.

14:53.360 --> 14:55.039
Ling Yun Fei will absolutely not detect them.

14:55.039 --> 14:56.860
When I meet Ling Yun Fei,

14:57.600 --> 14:59.720
I will release a crimson flame as the signal.

14:59.720 --> 15:00.960
Remember,

15:00.960 --> 15:05.419
keeping you and Miss Yan safe
is the top priority.

15:07.960 --> 15:10.600
It's dark, and the forest is deep.
There may be an ambush, Your Majesty.

15:10.600 --> 15:12.039
Perhaps you should return.

15:12.039 --> 15:13.759
We will surely rescue Miss Meng and Miss Yan.

15:13.759 --> 15:15.240
Huang is right.

15:15.240 --> 15:17.080
Ling Yun Fei is cruel. If he harms--

15:17.080 --> 15:21.460
That's why I must capture them personally.

15:22.336 --> 15:27.480
[Censorate]

15:27.480 --> 15:28.919
Let's go to the imperial palace.

15:28.919 --> 15:29.960
Le Yan!

15:29.960 --> 15:32.320
Sir, why are you here so late?

15:32.320 --> 15:33.679
Ling Yun Fei is cunning and peculiar.

15:33.679 --> 15:36.080
And the Censorate is his first target.

15:36.080 --> 15:37.240
So I'm worried about you.

15:37.240 --> 15:39.000
Are you going home?

15:39.000 --> 15:40.399
I'm going to the imperial palace.

15:40.399 --> 15:41.519
Le Yan,

15:41.519 --> 15:43.120
what is so urgent?

15:43.120 --> 15:44.120
Miss Meng is missing.

15:44.120 --> 15:45.879
She must have gone
to meet Ling Yun Fei alone.

15:45.879 --> 15:47.600
Yin Qing has taken the Light Cavalry
out of the city.

15:47.600 --> 15:48.799
But if there is no one to back her up,

15:48.799 --> 15:50.840
she will be in danger going alone.

15:50.840 --> 15:53.039
I must report to His Majesty
and ask him to send reinforcements.

15:53.039 --> 15:55.799
Where are Captain Di and Zhi Shu right now?

15:55.799 --> 15:59.519
Zhi Shu went long ago
to search for Miss Yan and Ling Yun Fei.

15:59.519 --> 16:02.360
Nian is probably with His Majesty.

16:02.360 --> 16:06.159
Ling Yun Fei will surely
get back at the entire Censorate.

16:06.159 --> 16:08.840
Since Zhi Shu and Di Nian are away,

16:08.840 --> 16:10.559
who will protect your family?

16:10.559 --> 16:13.559
You mobilize guards immediately
to defend your family.

16:13.559 --> 16:14.720
I will go to see His Majesty in your stead.

16:14.720 --> 16:16.519
But if His Majesty asks about the details--

16:16.519 --> 16:19.639
His Majesty knows Miss Meng very well.

16:19.639 --> 16:22.240
I will report properly to His Majesty.

16:22.240 --> 16:23.879
Don't worry.

16:23.879 --> 16:26.820
Take care of yourself and your family.

16:43.320 --> 16:44.820
Miss Meng.

16:45.480 --> 16:47.600
Haven't you always wanted to catch me?

16:47.600 --> 16:48.840
No more talking.

16:48.840 --> 16:51.220
I am already here.

16:51.960 --> 16:53.600
Release Yan Fu Zhi right now.

16:53.600 --> 16:55.100
Be patient.

16:55.759 --> 16:57.480
The real show is just beginning.

16:57.480 --> 16:58.980
Let me go!

17:03.519 --> 17:05.019
Fu Zhi!

17:10.039 --> 17:13.279
I've often dreamed of you recently.

17:13.279 --> 17:16.200
In my dreams, you were just like this,

17:16.200 --> 17:18.420
kneeling at my feet begging for mercy.

17:22.200 --> 17:24.299
I truly cannot understand.

17:25.440 --> 17:28.099
You and I were not enemies
in the first place.

17:29.240 --> 17:32.000
Why do you always target me relentlessly?

17:32.000 --> 17:36.480
You destroyed all the foundations I built.

17:36.480 --> 17:39.539
And you killed the woman I love most.

17:42.079 --> 17:43.839
So,

17:43.839 --> 17:47.519
how should I deal with you?

17:47.519 --> 17:49.019
Ling Yun Fei,

17:50.400 --> 17:53.019
you can do whatever you want

17:54.039 --> 17:55.640
with me.

17:55.640 --> 17:59.319
But right now, release Yan Fu Zhi first.

17:59.319 --> 18:01.059
If you hurt her,

18:01.960 --> 18:04.420
I will crush you to dust.

18:09.000 --> 18:11.420
What good sisters. So touching.

18:14.880 --> 18:18.220
You've been investigating the Eternity Pill,
haven't you?

18:24.920 --> 18:26.480
Meng!

18:26.480 --> 18:28.079
Let her go!

18:28.079 --> 18:30.140
Let her go and come at me!

18:33.599 --> 18:35.099
I'll grant your wish.

18:36.599 --> 18:38.279
Ling Yun Fei!

18:38.279 --> 18:39.519
Don't you touch Fu Zhi!

18:39.519 --> 18:42.599
The real killer of Liu Ru Yan
is someone else.

18:42.599 --> 18:43.839
You've got the wrong enemy.

18:43.839 --> 18:46.279
Even if we both die today,

18:46.279 --> 18:49.740
Liu Ru Yan will not rest in peace.

18:51.880 --> 18:53.599
I came here alone today.

18:53.599 --> 18:55.440
I'm not even afraid of death,

18:55.440 --> 18:57.039
so why would I lie?

18:57.039 --> 19:00.640
That day, I needed
to find your whereabouts from Liu Ru Yan,

19:00.640 --> 19:02.619
so how could I rashly kill her?

19:03.880 --> 19:06.960
Even if she didn't kill Ru Yan personally,

19:06.960 --> 19:08.359
she caused Ru Yan's death,

19:08.359 --> 19:10.319
my brother's death,

19:10.319 --> 19:12.759
and the deaths of dozens of brothers.

19:12.759 --> 19:15.160
If we don't cut her to pieces today,

19:15.160 --> 19:18.099
we'll fail Ru Yan and other dead brothers.

19:24.720 --> 19:25.839
Yes, this is the place.

19:25.839 --> 19:27.279
We're pressed for time.

19:27.279 --> 19:28.779
Come on.

19:36.279 --> 19:37.279
Sir!

19:37.279 --> 19:39.720
Ying Gua has led troops into the Huxiao Gang.

19:39.720 --> 19:41.380
It's inadvisable to confront them.

19:45.200 --> 19:49.160
Stop it! Let her go!

19:49.160 --> 19:51.000
Fu Zhi!

19:51.000 --> 19:52.039
Get off of her!

19:52.039 --> 19:54.859
Didn't you want revenge? Come at me!

19:56.359 --> 19:58.279
Stop!

19:58.279 --> 20:00.440
Stop it!

20:00.440 --> 20:01.799
Stop!

20:01.799 --> 20:03.579
Get off of her!

20:06.279 --> 20:07.779
No! Stop!

20:10.559 --> 20:11.559
Don't!

20:11.559 --> 20:13.440
You're her best friend.

20:13.440 --> 20:15.859
So you eat these for her.

20:17.799 --> 20:20.680
Listen, I killed Liu Ru Yan.

20:20.680 --> 20:22.799
I killed her.

20:22.799 --> 20:24.279
I did it.

20:24.279 --> 20:27.480
I watched her die by my hand.

20:27.480 --> 20:30.700
Before she died, she put on the best makeup

20:31.680 --> 20:33.859
and wore her fanciest clothes.

20:35.279 --> 20:38.059
She was looking forward to seeing you.

20:38.799 --> 20:40.420
What a pity.

20:41.440 --> 20:44.460
You didn't even get to see her one last time.

20:51.920 --> 20:54.019
You want to avenge her death, right?

20:55.799 --> 20:56.920
Kill me!

20:56.920 --> 20:59.019
Kill me right now!

21:07.559 --> 21:11.299
I'll now kill you to avenge Ru Yan's death!

21:12.599 --> 21:14.220
Ling Yun Fei!

21:22.839 --> 21:24.339
Fu Zhi!

21:30.920 --> 21:32.420
Master!

21:42.480 --> 21:43.720
Raid the Huxiao Gang!

21:43.720 --> 21:46.200
- Chase them!
- Yes!

21:46.200 --> 21:47.640
Fu Zhi!

21:47.640 --> 21:49.480
Are you alright?

21:49.480 --> 21:51.119
I'm fine.

21:51.119 --> 21:53.759
Fu Zhi, what's wrong with you?

21:53.759 --> 21:55.460
She was fed Eternity Pills.

21:56.839 --> 21:58.339
Fu Zhi.

22:02.240 --> 22:05.339
As you instructed,
Master Ling has evacuated safely.

22:08.279 --> 22:11.920
Ling Yun Fei is a handy weapon.
Losing him would be a loss.

22:11.920 --> 22:14.579
Besides, he knows too many secrets.

22:16.279 --> 22:17.720
Dead or alive,

22:17.720 --> 22:20.519
he must not fall into the court's hands.

22:20.519 --> 22:22.079
No worries, Master.

22:22.079 --> 22:24.039
The court has raided the Huxiao Gang,

22:24.039 --> 22:25.359
but the secret passage has been destroyed.

22:25.359 --> 22:28.299
They won't find him in a short time.

22:34.359 --> 22:36.160
Fu Zhi!

22:36.160 --> 22:37.920
Fu Zhi!

22:37.920 --> 22:39.599
Calm down!

22:39.599 --> 22:43.440
Stop breaking things! Fu Zhi!

22:43.440 --> 22:46.480
Fu Zhi, calm down!

22:46.480 --> 22:48.259
Hold on!

22:52.599 --> 22:57.039
Fu Zhi, stop breaking things!

22:57.039 --> 22:58.539
Stop it!

23:00.480 --> 23:02.019
Fu Zhi!

23:03.160 --> 23:07.720
Hold on!

23:07.720 --> 23:09.220
Fu Zhi!

23:10.880 --> 23:11.880
Fu Zhi!

23:11.880 --> 23:13.819
Just get through it, and you'll be fine.

23:14.759 --> 23:17.019
Hold on a little longer, alright?

23:20.480 --> 23:21.980
It's alright.

23:34.839 --> 23:36.920
Meng.

23:36.920 --> 23:39.480
Quick, give me the Eternity Pill.

23:39.480 --> 23:41.680
Please. Give me the Eternity Pill.

23:41.680 --> 23:44.039
I feel so awful, so awful.

23:44.039 --> 23:47.319
- Fu Zhi!
- Give me the Eternity Pill!

23:47.319 --> 23:50.460
Just get over it, and you'll be fine.

23:55.519 --> 23:59.279
Zhi Shu, give me the Eternity Pill.

23:59.279 --> 24:01.480
Please, give me the Eternity Pill.

24:01.480 --> 24:04.240
I feel so awful.
Give me the Eternity Pill, please!

24:04.240 --> 24:06.880
Fu Zhi, that will destroy you.

24:06.880 --> 24:08.359
I feel so awful.

24:08.359 --> 24:09.859
Fu Zhi!

24:11.400 --> 24:14.380
Wake up!

24:17.160 --> 24:18.920
Fu Zhi, let go!

24:18.920 --> 24:21.000
Fu Zhi, let go!

24:21.000 --> 24:22.319
- Stop biting!
- Miss Meng!

24:22.319 --> 24:23.359
- Fu Zhi!
- Miss Meng!

24:23.359 --> 24:24.799
We have to tie up Miss Yan.

24:24.799 --> 24:27.180
When her symptoms flare, she will hurt us.

24:29.480 --> 24:30.980
Let go!

24:33.279 --> 24:34.880
Give me the Eternity Pill!

24:34.880 --> 24:36.240
Or I will kill you all!

24:36.240 --> 24:38.480
Yan Fu Zhi, put down the knife!

24:38.480 --> 24:40.519
Fu Zhi, don't hurt yourself!

24:40.519 --> 24:42.019
Miss Yan!

24:49.599 --> 24:51.259
Mr. Shen, give me a hand!

24:58.839 --> 24:59.839
Let me go!

24:59.839 --> 25:03.940
Miss Meng, if we don't tie her up,
she will hurt herself too.

25:11.440 --> 25:12.940
Fu Zhi.

25:14.039 --> 25:16.900
Fu Zhi.

25:17.880 --> 25:21.099
Kill me, please!

25:21.720 --> 25:23.980
I'm in so much pain.

25:26.759 --> 25:28.519
It's too painful.

25:28.519 --> 25:30.160
Please.

25:30.160 --> 25:34.299
Kill me. Just kill me!

25:35.240 --> 25:36.900
Kill me!

25:40.480 --> 25:41.980
Fu Zhi!

25:56.400 --> 25:58.400
Yin Qing,

25:58.400 --> 26:00.660
you're skilled in toxicology.

26:06.039 --> 26:08.460
Please. Please save Fu Zhi.

26:09.640 --> 26:12.279
- Miss Meng!
- Please, think of a way.

26:12.279 --> 26:13.480
Get up.

26:13.480 --> 26:17.460
I'm begging you. Think of a way, please!

26:22.680 --> 26:25.339
Fu Zhi is my only family.

26:28.000 --> 26:31.359
I can exchange my life

26:31.359 --> 26:32.900
for her life.

26:33.680 --> 26:35.359
Miss Meng, get up.

26:35.359 --> 26:37.759
To save Miss Yan,

26:37.759 --> 26:40.079
I promise I will

26:40.079 --> 26:42.200
give everything I have.

26:42.200 --> 26:45.480
Miss Meng, Mr. Shen,

26:45.480 --> 26:47.680
this poison is rather strange.

26:47.680 --> 26:50.319
The imperial physician sent by His Majesty

26:50.319 --> 26:51.839
can't treat her either.

26:51.839 --> 26:55.880
I've searched through all medical books
and found no cure.

26:55.880 --> 26:58.079
Also, it could take months

26:58.079 --> 26:59.920
and even years to develop an antidote.

26:59.920 --> 27:01.420
But Miss Yan...

27:05.279 --> 27:06.980
I'm afraid she can last only three days.

27:13.000 --> 27:15.480
If she can get through it on her own,

27:15.480 --> 27:17.680
the toxicity will naturally weaken.

27:17.680 --> 27:19.180
Three days?

27:23.559 --> 27:25.380
Three days!

27:43.920 --> 27:45.420
Fu Zhi.

27:47.559 --> 27:49.059
Fu Zhi.

27:49.880 --> 27:51.720
Hold on!

27:51.720 --> 27:54.880
Bofeng House hasn't expanded
across the country.

27:54.880 --> 27:56.819
Forget high official positions or wealth.

27:57.839 --> 27:59.660
I don't want any of it.

28:00.359 --> 28:02.140
Let's go back to Shazhou.

28:03.720 --> 28:06.539
I just want you to be safe and sound.

28:09.039 --> 28:10.539
Please.

28:11.920 --> 28:13.500
Don't leave me behind.

28:16.960 --> 28:18.460
Please.

28:21.759 --> 28:23.359
I'm begging you.

28:23.359 --> 28:25.640
I heard
Jiang Mei Er came picking on you again.

28:25.640 --> 28:26.839
She really thinks we're easy to bully!

28:26.839 --> 28:29.160
Look, I'll smash her
with my abacus right now.

28:29.160 --> 28:32.440
But in my opinion,
nothing is worth risking your life.

28:32.440 --> 28:34.400
Let's go make our fortune in the capital.

28:34.400 --> 28:37.000
You open a restaurant,
and I'll pursue an official career.

28:37.000 --> 28:38.200
We will surely make it

28:38.200 --> 28:42.559
- in the capital.
- Capital, here we come!

28:42.559 --> 28:44.799
This is the luckiest draw I got for you
at Lingquan Temple.

28:44.799 --> 28:47.200
The master who interpreted the lot said
you will definitely pass the exam.

28:47.200 --> 28:48.940
I hope I can become an official

28:49.680 --> 28:51.259
and change my destiny.

28:51.920 --> 28:54.819
I hope I can protect the ones closest to me.

29:02.160 --> 29:04.839
I've already worked so hard.

29:04.839 --> 29:07.339
I've worked very hard.

29:08.960 --> 29:10.039
Meng.

29:10.039 --> 29:11.880
I know you have.

29:11.880 --> 29:14.099
I've seen your hard work.

29:14.720 --> 29:16.640
Even if you don't pass the exams,

29:16.640 --> 29:19.000
you're still the best in the world.

29:19.000 --> 29:21.319
You are the one and only Meng Ting Hui.

29:21.319 --> 29:24.200
Fu Zhi, I'm the Zhuangyuan!

29:24.200 --> 29:26.259
I'm the Zhuangyuan!

29:29.119 --> 29:31.359
Meng, here I am.

29:31.359 --> 29:32.839
You're talented.

29:32.839 --> 29:34.839
You'll get what you want!

29:34.839 --> 29:36.559
You're so cruel.

29:36.559 --> 29:38.960
We promised to go back to Shazhou together.

29:38.960 --> 29:40.480
You broke your promise.

29:40.480 --> 29:41.880
You must promise me.

29:41.880 --> 29:45.660
When helping others, protect yourself first.

29:47.319 --> 29:49.279
Stop!

29:49.279 --> 29:51.079
Stop it!

29:51.079 --> 29:52.160
Stop!

29:52.160 --> 29:54.059
Get off of her!

31:01.079 --> 31:03.819
Please, give me the Eternity Pill.

31:04.839 --> 31:06.779
I'll do what you say.

31:08.000 --> 31:09.940
I'll do what you say.

31:13.440 --> 31:16.519
What if I ask you to kill Meng Ting Hui?

31:16.519 --> 31:18.880
Okay, I'll kill her.

31:18.880 --> 31:20.619
I'll kill her.

31:21.720 --> 31:23.880
<i>Fu Zhi.</i>

31:23.880 --> 31:25.619
Wake up.

31:36.279 --> 31:39.680
Ms. Yan, this is Miss Meng!

31:39.680 --> 31:42.460
Let go of her.

31:44.039 --> 31:45.539
Miss Meng, are you alright?

31:46.640 --> 31:47.960
I am here.

31:47.960 --> 31:51.319
Meng, it's killing me.

31:51.319 --> 31:54.339
It's like bugs are biting all over my body.

31:55.160 --> 31:57.519
Please, kill me.

31:57.519 --> 31:59.359
There are bugs.

31:59.359 --> 32:01.400
Bugs are biting me.

32:01.400 --> 32:03.599
They're gnawing at my bones. It's killing me.

32:03.599 --> 32:06.259
Yin Qing, get her up.

32:07.319 --> 32:08.819
Be careful!

32:09.480 --> 32:11.059
Be careful!

32:12.039 --> 32:13.819
Fu Zhi, be careful.

32:28.279 --> 32:30.279
Meng.

32:30.279 --> 32:32.079
Kill me, please.

32:32.079 --> 32:33.740
Please.

32:34.480 --> 32:36.180
- Please.
- If you die,

32:37.400 --> 32:39.059
what will I do?

32:41.200 --> 32:43.180
If you die,

32:44.559 --> 32:46.579
I won't live either.

32:59.039 --> 33:00.539
I have the Eternity Pill here.

33:04.599 --> 33:06.920
Give it to me! Right now!

33:06.920 --> 33:08.420
Fu Zhi!

33:11.359 --> 33:12.940
Give it to me!

33:17.640 --> 33:18.680
Shen Zhi Shu,

33:18.680 --> 33:20.240
do you want to make her die faster?

33:20.240 --> 33:22.119
Do you want to watch her die in agony?

33:22.119 --> 33:24.559
Meng Ting Hui, you're her best friend.

33:24.559 --> 33:27.220
Don't you want her to die
a little more comfortably?

33:29.119 --> 33:30.700
She won't die.

33:32.400 --> 33:34.259
She absolutely will not die!

33:39.279 --> 33:41.059
If she...

33:44.920 --> 33:46.900
If she really...

33:47.799 --> 33:50.019
I'll die with her.

33:53.920 --> 33:58.759
I will never let her be alone.

33:58.759 --> 34:00.839
I just...

34:00.839 --> 34:02.740
I just can't see her in such pain.

34:03.960 --> 34:05.640
Miss Meng.

34:05.640 --> 34:07.759
Our caravans often travel to the border

34:07.759 --> 34:09.320
and search for the Ice Soul Pill.

34:09.320 --> 34:11.480
- It counters the heat of Wushi Powder.
- Fu Zhi.

34:11.480 --> 34:14.739
It's not an antidote for the Eternity Pill,
but it's much similar.

34:15.360 --> 34:16.599
In a life-or-death situation,

34:16.599 --> 34:19.239
I hope this will help Miss Yan get over it.

34:19.239 --> 34:23.619
Miss Meng, it's not a perfect remedy,
but it is worth a try.

34:38.960 --> 34:40.460
Fu Zhi.

34:41.519 --> 34:43.460
If this medicine kills you,

34:44.360 --> 34:46.500
I will die with you.

34:50.920 --> 34:52.679
- Fu Zhi.
- Let me check.

34:52.679 --> 34:54.179
Fu Zhi.

34:56.599 --> 34:58.099
Fu Zhi.

34:59.119 --> 35:02.500
Her pulse is weak, but the rate is stable.

35:03.599 --> 35:04.840
Tonight, at the hour of Zi,

35:04.840 --> 35:08.219
if the heat poison doesn't surge again,
she will be out of danger.

35:17.719 --> 35:20.519
We owe much to you, Miss Situ.

35:20.519 --> 35:23.440
Miss Yan and Miss Meng treated me
like a sister,

35:23.440 --> 35:25.920
so it's the least I can do.

35:25.920 --> 35:28.760
Tonight, Miss Yan is in critical condition.

35:28.760 --> 35:31.960
I will leave now and not disturb you all.

35:31.960 --> 35:34.699
It's late. I will see you out.

35:50.208 --> 35:53.076
[Censorate]

36:52.119 --> 36:56.019
Zhi Li, why are you still here so late?

37:09.280 --> 37:11.360
Why are you crying?

37:11.360 --> 37:13.239
Who made you cry?

37:13.239 --> 37:15.280
I originally thought

37:15.280 --> 37:18.679
that Miss Meng was afraid of nothing.

37:18.679 --> 37:21.159
But when Miss Yan's addiction flared up,

37:21.159 --> 37:23.199
Miss Meng hysterically cried,

37:23.199 --> 37:25.139
and even Zhi Shu cried.

37:26.000 --> 37:28.679
Nian, I am so scared.

37:28.679 --> 37:31.559
I'm afraid Miss Yan will never wake up again.

37:31.559 --> 37:33.699
I'm even more afraid
something might happen to you.

37:37.000 --> 37:40.320
Zhi Li, I've returned safely.

37:40.320 --> 37:41.820
I am fine.

37:43.960 --> 37:45.880
You've really grown bolder.

37:45.880 --> 37:49.519
Before sunset, Mr. Huang already
took the Light Cavalry and Divine Guards back.

37:49.519 --> 37:52.159
Yet you actually acted alone
and didn't return all night.

37:52.159 --> 37:53.960
What if you had encountered danger?

37:53.960 --> 37:57.300
Zhi Li, does your hand hurt?

37:58.519 --> 37:59.880
I've returned safely, haven't I?

37:59.880 --> 38:02.320
Can't you let me worry less?

38:02.320 --> 38:03.599
You just called me Zhi Li.

38:03.599 --> 38:04.960
Do you think you've grown up

38:04.960 --> 38:06.360
and don't have to listen to me?

38:06.360 --> 38:07.860
Call me sister.

38:08.719 --> 38:10.219
Sister.

38:13.320 --> 38:15.099
Stop pretending to be pitiful.

38:20.599 --> 38:22.099
Are you injured?

38:43.719 --> 38:47.400
I've never seen Zhi Shu look so worried.

38:47.400 --> 38:50.340
In truth, he has long been into Miss Yan,

38:50.960 --> 38:54.480
but he has always dissembled
and refused to admit it.

38:54.480 --> 38:56.599
Now, since Miss Yan is suffering,

38:56.599 --> 38:58.599
he is naturally heartbroken.

38:58.599 --> 39:01.300
I hope Miss Yan can pull through tonight.

39:02.119 --> 39:04.400
If anything happens to her,

39:04.400 --> 39:08.119
the light in his eyes
may be extinguished forever.

39:08.119 --> 39:10.099
And Miss Meng will collapse.

39:12.239 --> 39:14.739
I'll surely bring Ling Yun Fei to justice.

39:17.480 --> 39:20.739
I hope Miss Yan will get through it.

39:22.119 --> 39:25.119
How did you get so badly injured?

39:25.119 --> 39:28.320
I accidentally scraped myself
while searching the valleys on the outskirts.

39:28.320 --> 39:30.840
It was a long way away,
so I returned a bit late.

39:30.840 --> 39:32.599
Did you find anything there?

39:32.599 --> 39:34.199
It still needs more time.

39:34.199 --> 39:36.119
You were gone
for a whole day and night without news

39:36.119 --> 39:37.519
and came back with wounds.

39:37.519 --> 39:39.420
Do you have any idea how worried I was?

39:41.880 --> 39:43.280
Why are you smiling?

39:43.280 --> 39:44.820
You care about me.

39:46.199 --> 39:48.380
When have I not cared about you?

39:51.239 --> 39:53.039
You'd better go see a physician tomorrow.

39:53.039 --> 39:54.539
Got it.

40:05.320 --> 40:06.880
What is this?

40:06.880 --> 40:09.320
I found this while searching the valleys.

40:09.320 --> 40:12.360
I heard that carrying it brings good luck.

40:12.360 --> 40:14.539
I think you are the one
who needs some good luck.

40:19.840 --> 40:22.539
You take a rest. I'll go check on Miss Yan.

40:27.599 --> 40:29.400
I'll go with you.

40:29.400 --> 40:32.019
You rest well and return home early.

40:40.480 --> 40:44.980
[Bofeng House]

40:48.039 --> 40:49.539
Madam.

40:50.599 --> 40:53.360
I wonder how Ms. Yan is doing.

40:53.360 --> 40:54.400
Madam.

40:54.400 --> 40:56.880
You usually compete fiercely
for business with Ms. Yan,

40:56.880 --> 40:59.239
but you still care about her quite a bit.

40:59.239 --> 41:00.519
These are two different things.

41:00.519 --> 41:03.239
Haven't you seen
how terrifying those Eternity Pill users are?

41:03.239 --> 41:05.199
The head of the Zhao family and his mother

41:05.199 --> 41:07.179
are both dead.

41:09.400 --> 41:13.000
It's not easy for a woman like Ms. Yan
to build her career out there.

41:13.000 --> 41:15.739
Thanks to Miss Meng, she was saved.
